contentText:
Lizzo thinks Taylor Swift is 100% that b&#8212;h when it comes to cultivating her fanbase. While guesting on the Proto Pop web series episode posted Sunday (June 28), the Yitty founder praised the pop superstar for making community a cornerstone of her career.

